## Response Patterns

### Success Response

```typescript
return new Response(JSON.stringify({
  // Your data
  events: [...],
  customers: [...],
  
  // Metadata (always include)
  requestId: requestId,
  timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
  
  // Pagination (if applicable)
  total: total,
  limit: limit,
  offset: offset
}), {
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    'Access-Control-Allow-Origin': '*'
  }
});
```

### Error Response (Automatic)

When using `createErrorResponse()`, format is:

```json
{
  "error": "ERROR_CODE",
  "code": "ERROR_CODE",
  "message": "Human-readable message",
  "details": { /* optional */ },
  "requestId": "abc123",
  "timestamp": "2025-10-07T14:45:00.000Z",
  "path": "/api/endpoint"
}
```

